          <p class="eyebrow">Software Engineer · Fullstack</p>
          <h1>Hi, I’m <span class="accent">Mouadh Wahada</span>.</h1>
          <p class="subtitle">
            I build modern web applications using <strong>Spring Boot</strong>, <strong>Angular</strong> and
            <strong>FastAPI</strong>, with a strong focus on clean architecture, DevOps and automation.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
