    <!-- ABOUT -->
    <section id="about" class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>About me</h2>
        <p>
          I am a Software Engineer passionate about building end-to-end solutions that solve real business problems.
          During my PFE, I designed and developed a full <strong>ERP web application</strong> for a company, covering
          sales, purchases, license management and supplier relations.
        </p>
        <p>
          My stack is mainly based on <strong>Spring Boot</strong> for the backend, <strong>Angular</strong> for the frontend,
          and <strong>FastAPI</strong> for AI-driven microservices. I also enjoy working with
          <strong>Docker</strong>, <strong>GitHub Actions</strong> and <strong>CI/CD</strong> to automate build, test
          and deployment pipelines.
        </p>
        <p>
          I like clean code, clear architecture, and working in Agile/Scrum environments where collaboration and continuous
          improvement are part of the culture.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

