  <section id="projects" class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Selected Projects</h2>

    <!-- ERP PROJECT -->
    <div class="project-card">
      <h3>INSOMEA ERP – Sales, Purchases & License Management</h3>
      <p class="project-meta">Spring Boot · Angular · FastAPI · Docker · GitHub Actions</p>
      <p>
        End-to-end ERP web application developed as my engineering graduation project. The platform automates
        sales, purchases, license renewals, customer relations, and supplier management with integrated DevOps workflows.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Developed secure REST APIs (JWT, email verification, password reset).</li>
        <li>Built an Angular frontend with dashboards, workflows, and client portals.</li>
        <li>Created a FastAPI microservice for supplier ranking and price estimation.</li>
        <li>Implemented a monorepo CI pipeline with build, test, coverage, and Docker deployment.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- NEW PROJECT 1 -->
    <div class="project-card">
      <h3>Vitanova – Fitness & Coaching Web Platform</h3>
      <p class="project-meta">Spring Boot · Angular · MySQL</p>
      <p>
        A complete fitness web application designed to help users achieve their health goals through personalized training programs,
        access to coaches, and product delivery services. Includes workout planning, coaching sessions, nutrition guidance,
        and equipment ordering.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Implemented training plans, coach sessions, and user tracking.</li>
        <li>Developed a modular backend with Spring Boot (REST + JPA).</li>
        <li>Built responsive Angular interfaces with dynamic user dashboards.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- NEW PROJECT 2 -->
    <div class="project-card">
      <h3>Explorex – Travel Planning & Itinerary System</h3>
      <p class="project-meta">Symfony · MySQL</p>
      <p>
        Explorex is an innovative travel planning web application offering personalized itineraries, route search, plan selection, and online booking.
        The platform focuses on user-friendly navigation and customized travel experiences.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Developed itinerary search and reservation management.</li>
        <li>Implemented admin dashboards for plan & package management.</li>
        <li>Designed database models and business workflows using Symfony.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- NEW PROJECT 3 -->
    <div class="project-card">
      <h3>BwsHistory – Spare Parts Tracking & After-Sales System</h3>
      <p class="project-meta">Quarkus · Angular · MySQL · Postman</p>
      <p>
        BwsHistory is a web-based system for managing spare parts, sales, repairs, interventions, and customer history using unique identification (CIN).
        It provides dashboards, intervention tracking, and repair reports to improve transparency and customer satisfaction.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Created modules for sales, repairs, replacements, and client tracking.</li>
        <li>Implemented notifications, intervention logs, and technician reports.</li>
        <li>Used Quarkus to build a fast, lightweight microservice backend.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- EXISTING PROJECT -->
    <div class="project-card">
      <h3>Authentication & User Management Module</h3>
      <p class="project-meta">Spring Boot · Angular · JWT · Email (SMTP)</p>
      <p>
        Reusable authentication module with secure registration, login, and email-based verification.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>JWT authentication with refresh tokens.</li>
        <li>Angular interceptors, guards, and role-based UI.</li>
        <li>Email verification and password reset flows.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

